{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Read the security warnings desk"},"description":"Returns the published warnings register: four evergreen threat types (what multisig limits and what it does not stop), then each published incident with its reviewed state (active or historical), its review freshness (current, or overdue once its review-by date passes), who it applies to, statuses, facts, the recommended action, evidence, dates, review owner and source link. An overdue active incident is 'previously assessed as active; review overdue', not resolved. status says whether the register was read just now (current) or is degraded (stale, bundled, unavailable); a degraded desk may be incomplete and never means nothing is wrong. Omit warningId to list every published incident; filter by state or threatType.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"state":{"enum":["active","historical"],"type":"string"},"threatType":{"enum":["supply-chain","seed-generation","firmware","impersonation"],"type":"string"},"warningId":{"maxLength":80,"pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]+$","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"read_warning","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"desk":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"active":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"evergreen":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"description":{"type":"string"},"href":{"format":"uri","type":"string"},"label":{"type":"string"}},"required":["label","href","description"],"type":"object"},"historical":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"overdue":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"scope":{"type":"string"},"statement":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":["scope","active"